            "description": "Watch Almeria vs Malaga highlights and goals from Segunda División on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on June 20, 2026. Almeria and Malaga locked horns in a pivotal encounter that had fans on the edge of their seats from start to finish. The tension was palpable as both sides looked to gain an edge in this highly anticipated Segunda División clash. Second Half Surge The contest on June 20, 2026 , began with a cautious approach from both sides, but the intensity ramped up immediately after the interval. After D. Lopy saw yellow for Almeria just after the restart, the match exploded into life. It was Malaga who broke the deadlock in the 65th minute when Chupete found the back of the net following a precise assist from J. Munoz . The goalscorer was booked just moments later as the emotions of the game began to boil over. Late Drama and Dismissals Malaga doubled their advantage in the 72nd minute, with D. Larrubia clinical in his finish after being set up by the influential Chupete . However, Almeria refused to go down without a fight. In the 76th minute, L. Baptistão pulled one back for the hosts, assisted by A. Embarba , setting up a grandstand finish. The closing stages were marked by incredible friction; Almeria 's T. H. Thalys was shown a straight red card in the 95th minute, and Malaga 's A. Ochoa followed him to the dressing room after receiving a second yellow deep in stoppage time."
